    "name": "main_thread_handle",
    "offset": "0x10"
   },
   {
    "evidence": "incremented, null-guarded, by every spawn body on the fresh cell\u2019s context word (A 0x15b835a, X4 0x5cd96e3, X5 0x5cf70ec), overflow to the scoped.rs:60 panic stub; decremented by the payload drops when a packet is discarded",
